!! Multifrontal direct solver with a leftover PRECOND (METHOD=DIRECTmf, PRECOND=5):
!! a control file converted from an iterative solver keeps its PRECOND, which a direct
!! method never uses; both option lines must still reach DIRECTmf (issue #930). The log
!! check asserts the real line (pivot threshold 0.25) and the integer line (compressed
!! tiles) took effect.
!BOUNDARY
  FIX, 1, 3,   0.0
!CLOAD
  CL1,    3,  -1.0
!!
!! SOLVER CONTROL
!!
!SOLVER,METHOD=DIRECTmf,PRECOND=5,ITERLOG=YES,TIMELOG=YES,LOGLEVEL=1
 10000, 1
 1.0e-8, 1.0, 0.0
 0, 0, 1, 0, 12, 0, -1
 0.0, 0.0, 0.25
!WRITE,RESULT
!END
